<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.6; color:#1E293B;"><span style="font-size:14px">Profession ou Fonction : </span><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Recteur de l''Université</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.6; color:#1E293B;"><span style="font-size:14px">De se rend</span><span style="font-size:14px">re </span><span style="font-size:14px">à</span><span style="font-size:14px"> :</span><span style="font-size:14px"> </span><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Conakry </strong></span><span style="font-size:14px"><strong> </strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.6; color:#1E293B;"><span style="font-size:14px">Objet de la Mission :</span><span style="font-size:14px"> </span><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Raisons de Service</strong></span><span style="font-size:14px"><strong> </strong></span></p>
