<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.6; color:#1E293B;"><span style="font-size:14px">Date de Dé</span><span style="font-size:14px">part</span><span style="font-size:14px">:</span><span style="font-size:14px"> </span><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>1</strong></span><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>3</strong></span><span style="font-size:14px"><strong> Jui</strong></span><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>llet</strong></span><span style="font-size:14px"><strong> 2026</strong></span></p>
